WEBVTT

00:00:00.941 --> 00:00:03.543
Twelve years ago,

00:00:03.543 --> 00:00:07.104
a disaster called Blast Fall occurred.

00:00:08.181 --> 00:00:10.250
At the time, I was a police officer.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:15.422
I had lost my wife to illness
and I lived alone with our daughter.

00:00:15.422 --> 00:00:19.893
In her bed at the hospital,
my wife's final words were,

00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:22.128
"Take care of our daughter."

00:00:22.128 --> 00:00:26.800
But I wasn't able to keep that promise.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.138
Our daughter was caught in Blast Fall
and went missing.

00:00:32.138 --> 00:00:36.176
Even so, I have faith

00:00:36.176 --> 00:00:40.447
that our daughter is alive.

00:00:40.447 --> 00:00:44.247
To keep my promise to her.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.499
It's not bad.

00:00:59.499 --> 00:01:01.134
I'd say it's about 30 points.

00:01:01.134 --> 00:01:02.235
What?!

00:01:02.235 --> 00:01:05.305
It's just... I don't know how to put it...

00:01:05.305 --> 00:01:09.909
There's nothing that
really hits you emotionally.

00:01:09.909 --> 00:01:11.211
Do you get it?

00:01:11.211 --> 00:01:12.803
No, I do not.

00:01:15.682 --> 00:01:17.150
I understand.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.052
I will train hard!

00:01:19.052 --> 00:01:23.923
I will train hard, so I can
get a better score next time!

00:01:23.923 --> 00:01:25.618
Good luck.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:38.171
You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I've wanted to hear about?

00:01:38.171 --> 00:01:44.633
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:01:46.346 --> 00:01:56.322
It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page

00:01:56.322 --> 00:01:58.491
And that's how fate
brought us together

00:01:58.491 --> 00:02:06.666
More than those words
that you once kept to yourself

00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:15.575
It's the kindness that made you
keep them to yourself

00:02:15.575 --> 00:02:22.582
That I want to have faith in now

00:02:22.582 --> 00:02:30.223
You know, we'll be living alongside
uncertainty from now on

00:02:30.223 --> 00:02:36.629
We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now

00:02:36.629 --> 00:02:44.337
You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I didn't know about before?

00:02:44.337 --> 00:02:50.577
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:02:50.577 --> 00:02:54.411
It's something to build up
bit by bit

00:03:02.755 --> 00:03:07.590
"Girls' Day Off"

00:03:10.494 --> 00:03:12.096
Maintenance complete.

00:03:12.096 --> 00:03:14.587
Switching to awakening mode.

00:03:18.435 --> 00:03:22.172
Today's regular maintenance
program is complete.

00:03:22.172 --> 00:03:24.106
Thank you for your patience.

00:03:34.284 --> 00:03:36.620
I guess that's it for today.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.255
What are you going to do, Integra?

00:03:38.255 --> 00:03:39.790
What do you mean?

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:42.760
We have half the day off, right?
What are you going to do?

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:46.196
I plan to enjoy a nice,
leisurely shopping trip.

00:03:46.196 --> 00:03:47.498
Good idea.

00:03:47.498 --> 00:03:49.066
I'm not taking you with me!

00:03:49.066 --> 00:03:52.336
I have a policy about keeping work
separate from my private life.

00:03:52.336 --> 00:03:55.372
I want to spend some time alone
when I'm off duty at least.

00:03:55.372 --> 00:03:56.807
Talk about cold.

00:03:56.807 --> 00:03:59.643
Well, Accela, I'll be over
for dinner tonight.

00:03:59.643 --> 00:04:01.812
Oh, okay.

00:04:01.812 --> 00:04:04.715
What about you, Accela?
What are you doing today?

00:04:04.715 --> 00:04:09.987
Oh, I think I'll be taking it easy
at home today.

00:04:09.987 --> 00:04:11.055
I see...

00:04:11.055 --> 00:04:12.420
Yes.

00:04:14.191 --> 00:04:16.250
What should I make today?

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.633
Oh? Work?

00:04:22.633 --> 00:04:23.867
No.

00:04:23.867 --> 00:04:26.203
What? Where are you going?

00:04:26.203 --> 00:04:28.433
I'll be back by evening.

00:04:29.606 --> 00:04:33.940
I had no idea that old man
had places to go outside of work.

00:04:35.412 --> 00:04:36.580
Solty!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.683
Yes, yes! What is it?

00:04:39.683 --> 00:04:42.419
Do you know where that old man went?

00:04:42.419 --> 00:04:44.922
No, I do not know.

00:04:44.922 --> 00:04:46.287
Oh, okay.

00:04:55.299 --> 00:04:57.067
Solty. Solty!

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:58.969
Yes, what is it?

00:04:58.969 --> 00:05:00.270
I've got some time on my hands,

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.406
so you want to go out
and have some fun together?

00:05:02.406 --> 00:05:06.643
I am sorry. I am training
right now and I cannot leave.

00:05:06.643 --> 00:05:08.812
Oh, the pot is boiling over!

00:05:08.812 --> 00:05:12.516
Oh, the frying pan is in
a dangerous situation!

00:05:12.516 --> 00:05:13.617
Water! Water!

00:05:13.617 --> 00:05:17.921
Oh, things are getting even worse!

00:05:17.921 --> 00:05:19.857
You look busy.

00:05:19.857 --> 00:05:21.992
I'll go find someone else.

00:05:21.992 --> 00:05:24.394
Set the electromagnetic actuator
and real balancer to 50.

00:05:24.394 --> 00:05:26.330
Connect them with a synchro-cable and...

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.364
Oh, it's no good!

00:05:27.364 --> 00:05:29.967
That causes problems with both
the waste heat and capacity!

00:05:29.967 --> 00:05:31.093
Gag.

00:05:38.675 --> 00:05:41.769
Kasha's wandered off somewhere, too.

00:05:46.049 --> 00:05:48.252
Are you playing hooky again?

00:05:48.252 --> 00:05:50.788
Hello, we meet again.

00:05:50.788 --> 00:05:53.891
Are you sure you can afford to keep
playing hooky out here like this?

00:05:53.891 --> 00:05:57.327
Well, I do not want to play hooky,

00:05:57.327 --> 00:05:59.596
but I hate my work.

00:05:59.596 --> 00:06:05.502
You really are a weird guy
for an elite member of the RUC.

00:06:05.502 --> 00:06:07.838
I think so myself.

00:06:07.838 --> 00:06:11.675
Is RUC work that boring?

00:06:11.675 --> 00:06:14.044
No, not exactly.

00:06:14.044 --> 00:06:16.239
Oh, really.

00:06:18.182 --> 00:06:20.284
Actually...

00:06:20.284 --> 00:06:21.251
Huh?

00:06:21.251 --> 00:06:25.722
I came here today
with a purpose in mind.

00:06:25.722 --> 00:06:29.893
I was hoping I might see you again.

00:06:29.893 --> 00:06:31.428
What do you say?

00:06:31.428 --> 00:06:33.363
If you have some free time,

00:06:33.363 --> 00:06:37.301
won't you keep me company
for a little while?

00:06:37.301 --> 00:06:38.902
Is that...

00:06:38.902 --> 00:06:40.571
...an invitation to go on a date?

00:06:40.571 --> 00:06:44.268
To put it bluntly, yes.
What do you think?

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.112
A date with me doesn't come cheap.

00:06:49.112 --> 00:06:50.943
Please leave it to me.

00:07:01.325 --> 00:07:06.430
The day to remember you
has come again this year.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.897
Sarah.

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:22.412
I'm sorry.

00:07:22.412 --> 00:07:26.316
But I'll keep my promise
with you, no matter what.

00:07:26.316 --> 00:07:29.786
I'll find Rita without fail, you'll see.

00:07:29.786 --> 00:07:35.418
So, watch over us from
where you are, Sarah.

00:07:36.793 --> 00:07:38.590
I'll come again.

00:08:04.655 --> 00:08:07.557
Wh-What happened to you?

00:08:07.557 --> 00:08:10.894
The kitchen is in a terrible state!

00:08:10.894 --> 00:08:14.386
You're in a plenty
terrible state yourself...

00:08:16.266 --> 00:08:17.534
I see.

00:08:17.534 --> 00:08:20.971
So those two were hard
on you with their scores.

00:08:20.971 --> 00:08:24.675
Yes, they were.

00:08:24.675 --> 00:08:26.343
But it's strange.

00:08:26.343 --> 00:08:27.678
When I tasted your cooking before,

00:08:27.678 --> 00:08:29.913
it was good, just like it
was supposed to be.

00:08:29.913 --> 00:08:32.883
Perhaps I had not trained hard enough.

00:08:32.883 --> 00:08:36.687
Do you think so?
I don't think that's true.

00:08:36.687 --> 00:08:39.189
Besides, considering their personalities,

00:08:39.189 --> 00:08:41.224
they probably wouldn't
praise you to your face.

00:08:41.224 --> 00:08:45.195
Um, so Ms. Miranda...

00:08:45.195 --> 00:08:47.164
I know.

00:08:47.164 --> 00:08:50.300
You want those two to say
your cooking is delicious, right?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.736
Yes! Yes!

00:08:52.736 --> 00:08:54.705
Let me think...

00:08:54.705 --> 00:08:58.308
Okay, I'll teach you my best dish!

00:08:58.308 --> 00:08:59.935
Your best!

00:09:05.282 --> 00:09:08.652
Splendid!

00:09:08.652 --> 00:09:10.454
It suits you wonderfully.

00:09:10.454 --> 00:09:11.288
What?

00:09:11.288 --> 00:09:13.156
D-Do you think so?

00:09:13.156 --> 00:09:13.957
Here.

00:09:13.957 --> 00:09:15.049
Huh?

00:09:18.028 --> 00:09:22.466
I'm glad. It matches the outfit,
just as I thought it would.

00:09:22.466 --> 00:09:24.501
Shall we go, then?

00:09:24.501 --> 00:09:25.635
What?

00:09:25.635 --> 00:09:27.227
To eat.

00:09:29.439 --> 00:09:31.407
In my car.

00:09:34.077 --> 00:09:35.412
Come, let us go.

00:09:35.412 --> 00:09:36.580
C-Certainly.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.411
Thank you very much!

00:09:40.484 --> 00:09:43.086
What's going on?

00:09:43.086 --> 00:09:46.189
Sheesh! They hired us
to arbitrate a marital spat,

00:09:46.189 --> 00:09:49.192
but when I got there,
they were all over each other!

00:09:49.192 --> 00:09:52.362
What the hell do they think we are?!

00:09:52.362 --> 00:09:53.663
Oh...

00:09:53.663 --> 00:09:55.599
Please, get in.

00:09:55.599 --> 00:09:57.501
R-Rose?

00:09:57.501 --> 00:09:59.836
What's this? What's this?
Who's that man?

00:09:59.836 --> 00:10:02.100
Who's that woman?!

00:10:05.976 --> 00:10:07.773
Is something the matter?

00:10:09.012 --> 00:10:10.781
It must have been my imagination.

00:10:10.781 --> 00:10:13.650
- Do you know that woman?
- Do you know that man?

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:16.219
Who the hell is she?!

00:10:16.219 --> 00:10:19.122
What about you?!
Who is that man?!

00:10:19.122 --> 00:10:20.282
Whoops!

00:10:25.429 --> 00:10:26.953
Taxi!

00:10:41.912 --> 00:10:44.681
Every once in a while, you really
just have to go on a spending spree.

00:10:44.681 --> 00:10:46.817
Why did you run out of taxi fare?!

00:10:46.817 --> 00:10:50.187
I couldn't help it! I didn't
have any cash on hand!

00:10:50.187 --> 00:10:51.288
What about credit cards?

00:10:51.288 --> 00:10:54.155
I make a point of not charging
any more than I have to!

00:10:56.493 --> 00:10:59.129
I-I saw nothing at all.

00:10:59.129 --> 00:11:02.587
I saw nothing. I saw nothing.
I saw nothing. I saw nothing.

00:11:04.868 --> 00:11:06.169
Damn it!

00:11:06.169 --> 00:11:09.263
They're going to get farther
and farther away at this rate!

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:16.746
Hurry up and get in!
You look disgraceful!

00:11:16.746 --> 00:11:20.183
Man, you sure saved us!

00:11:20.183 --> 00:11:24.454
I guess good coworkers
are a blessing to have.

00:11:24.454 --> 00:11:26.890
Don't get too wild
and crazy on me, okay?

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:29.426
I'm the one who'll get
chewed out for it later.

00:11:29.426 --> 00:11:32.562
So? Why are you two together?

00:11:32.562 --> 00:11:33.363
Huh?

00:11:33.363 --> 00:11:34.965
You two?

00:11:34.965 --> 00:11:37.033
Don't you remember?

00:11:37.033 --> 00:11:39.297
We've met you once before.

00:11:42.038 --> 00:11:43.974
Oh! Oh! Oh!

00:11:43.974 --> 00:11:46.176
Huh? We have?

00:11:46.176 --> 00:11:48.144
You should remember these things.

00:11:49.279 --> 00:11:52.549
Are your mother and that girl
with long ears doing well?

00:11:52.549 --> 00:11:56.653
Y-Yes, I guess.

00:11:56.653 --> 00:11:58.889
So they're RUC...

00:11:58.889 --> 00:12:02.759
Does that mean maybe I shouldn't
say anything about Rose?

00:12:02.759 --> 00:12:05.028
So, why were you running?

00:12:05.028 --> 00:12:08.165
That's right! We need you
to step on it and follow that car!

00:12:08.165 --> 00:12:10.100
That car? Why?

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.701
Don't worry about that! Hurry!

00:12:11.701 --> 00:12:16.006
Uh, um, if it seems too hard,
you don't have to follow them...

00:12:16.006 --> 00:12:17.607
What are you saying?!

00:12:17.607 --> 00:12:20.098
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:12:21.745 --> 00:12:25.112
I'll show you my driving technique!

00:12:34.424 --> 00:12:39.293
Whoops. It looks like I passed
our target car. I'm sorry.

00:12:44.167 --> 00:12:46.069
Please, help yourself.

00:12:46.069 --> 00:12:50.640
The food here is very highly rated.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.471
I-I see.

00:12:53.643 --> 00:12:57.647
Oh, it's our division chief.

00:12:57.647 --> 00:12:59.182
I feel sick.

00:12:59.182 --> 00:13:01.785
You're pitiful.
That was nothing.

00:13:01.785 --> 00:13:04.688
Y-You call that nothing?

00:13:04.688 --> 00:13:07.123
You drive too aggressively.

00:13:07.123 --> 00:13:10.994
So, who's the woman
with the division chief?

00:13:10.994 --> 00:13:12.462
No idea.

00:13:12.462 --> 00:13:16.262
Oh, what the heck?
They don't know it's Rose.

00:13:18.868 --> 00:13:21.104
What is the matter?

00:13:21.104 --> 00:13:23.607
Was it not to your taste?

00:13:23.607 --> 00:13:27.771
Oh, no, I thought I'd take my time
and savor the food as I ate...

00:13:31.715 --> 00:13:36.118
More like, I'm not used to meals
like this, so I can't help it!

00:13:45.095 --> 00:13:47.791
W-Was that static electricity?

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:51.835
In situations like this,

00:13:51.835 --> 00:13:54.704
you can call a waiter over
and have him pick it up for you.

00:13:54.704 --> 00:13:57.798
Y-Yes, of course.
I'd forgotten.

00:14:02.012 --> 00:14:06.182
What's with that?! What's with
that gesture of embarrassment?!

00:14:06.182 --> 00:14:07.651
Hey.

00:14:07.651 --> 00:14:09.786
What? That's how it is with you?

00:14:09.786 --> 00:14:10.854
What?

00:14:10.854 --> 00:14:12.589
- Oh, this is interesting!
- The chief, huh?

00:14:12.589 --> 00:14:14.921
I should've brought Solty along, too!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.561
Bay laurel leaves...

00:14:18.561 --> 00:14:21.231
Bay laurel leaves...

00:14:21.231 --> 00:14:23.756
Where could it be?

00:14:24.801 --> 00:14:29.039
The bay leaves are
the last thing I need.

00:14:29.039 --> 00:14:30.774
Oh, excuse me.

00:14:30.774 --> 00:14:33.176
Huh? What is it?

00:14:33.176 --> 00:14:38.315
I was wondering if you could tell me
where I could find "bay leaves"?

00:14:38.315 --> 00:14:40.283
Oh! You're...

00:14:41.584 --> 00:14:43.609
...from that one time...

00:14:45.088 --> 00:14:47.123
Here.

00:14:47.123 --> 00:14:50.593
So these are the bay laurel leaves?

00:14:50.593 --> 00:14:52.962
Are they edible?

00:14:52.962 --> 00:14:56.766
Bay laurel leaves are used
to add fragrance,

00:14:56.766 --> 00:15:00.937
so you put it in dishes to eliminate
odors from meats and fish.

00:15:00.937 --> 00:15:04.240
You must like to cook.

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:05.342
Yes, I do.

00:15:05.342 --> 00:15:08.478
I like to cook, too,
but I am still training...

00:15:08.478 --> 00:15:12.073
Oh, I'm sorry.
I need to get going.

00:15:13.083 --> 00:15:15.415
Thank you very much!

00:15:26.796 --> 00:15:28.423
Please, go right in.

00:15:32.502 --> 00:15:35.739
Damn it! This is the VIP only elevator!

00:15:35.739 --> 00:15:37.107
We can't go in?

00:15:37.107 --> 00:15:38.875
We don't have access.

00:15:38.875 --> 00:15:42.212
In that case, I'll climb up
from the outside...

00:15:42.212 --> 00:15:44.013
Stop this!

00:15:44.013 --> 00:15:45.281
Don't stop me, Integra!

00:15:45.281 --> 00:15:47.650
Please, stop!

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:49.018
You have it rough...

00:15:49.018 --> 00:15:50.952
I do have it rough.

00:15:52.322 --> 00:15:54.157
Wow!

00:15:54.157 --> 00:15:55.825
What do you think?

00:15:55.825 --> 00:15:59.784
I reserved this place
tonight just for you.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.832
So beautiful.

00:16:02.832 --> 00:16:04.060
Yes.

00:16:05.435 --> 00:16:07.604
Truly.

00:16:07.604 --> 00:16:10.573
What's going on up there?!
What's going on?!

00:16:10.573 --> 00:16:12.976
Adult?! Adult?!
An adult situation?!

00:16:12.976 --> 00:16:16.246
Stop it! I don't want
to imagine stuff like that!

00:16:16.246 --> 00:16:18.515
Mom! Solty!

00:16:18.515 --> 00:16:19.416
Oh, just shut up!

00:16:19.416 --> 00:16:21.407
- Shut up! Shut up!
- I want to go home.

00:16:25.989 --> 00:16:29.759
The night view of this city
is so beautiful,

00:16:29.759 --> 00:16:33.763
but unfortunately,
it is full with sorrow.

00:16:33.763 --> 00:16:37.434
The disparity between the rich
and the poor only continues to grow.

00:16:37.434 --> 00:16:41.938
In addition, the unregistered
residents have no security

00:16:41.938 --> 00:16:44.908
and their lives are too
dreadful to behold.

00:16:44.908 --> 00:16:48.912
This is wrong.

00:16:48.912 --> 00:16:51.848
All people should be equal,

00:16:51.848 --> 00:16:56.219
just as the sun shines on us all
regardless of our station in life.

00:16:56.219 --> 00:17:02.459
Just as the curtain of night
brings sleep to us all.

00:17:02.459 --> 00:17:08.887
Is it strange for an RUC man
like myself to think such thoughts?

00:17:10.233 --> 00:17:11.868
No.

00:17:11.868 --> 00:17:15.672
I hope such a day will come someday.

00:17:15.672 --> 00:17:19.574
On that someday, let us
come here again together.

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.910
Yes, on that someday.

00:17:28.318 --> 00:17:30.920
Division Chief, I have faith in you.

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:33.189
Let's go home already.

00:17:33.189 --> 00:17:34.918
I'm tired.

00:17:38.394 --> 00:17:41.564
Yup! You got everything
I asked you to get.

00:17:41.564 --> 00:17:42.966
Thank goodness.

00:17:42.966 --> 00:17:45.735
So, what are we making?

00:17:45.735 --> 00:17:50.434
This is a dish I learned
from my best friend.

00:17:51.908 --> 00:17:55.612
Are you sure you don't
want me to see you home?

00:17:55.612 --> 00:18:00.283
Yes. I feel like walking a little.

00:18:00.283 --> 00:18:03.453
Will I see you again?

00:18:03.453 --> 00:18:05.944
If the mood strikes me.

00:18:11.127 --> 00:18:13.630
Say!

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:17.534
I'll really be looking forward to it.

00:18:17.534 --> 00:18:22.071
I'll be looking forward
to when that day comes.

00:18:22.071 --> 00:18:23.732
It's a promise.

00:18:30.246 --> 00:18:32.916
Come on out, Kasha!

00:18:32.916 --> 00:18:35.351
Y-You knew?

00:18:35.351 --> 00:18:38.411
Don't you underestimate Rose the Thief!

00:18:40.089 --> 00:18:42.358
Say...

00:18:42.358 --> 00:18:45.759
Could it be that you've
fallen in love?

00:18:47.297 --> 00:18:49.999
Don't give me that sassy talk!

00:18:49.999 --> 00:18:52.035
Man, I'm hungry!

00:18:52.035 --> 00:18:54.270
Let's hurry up and go home.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.602
I'm hungrier than you are!

00:19:01.077 --> 00:19:04.147
Come on, stop crying already.

00:19:04.147 --> 00:19:06.182
You're a grown-up for heaven's sake!

00:19:06.182 --> 00:19:10.320
Damn it! I'm gonna drink!
I'm gonna drink tonight!

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:12.789
Then I'll drop you off
at your usual bar.

00:19:12.789 --> 00:19:13.990
Keep me company!

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:15.389
Keep me company!

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:32.041
Welcome.

00:19:32.041 --> 00:19:34.577
Dinner will be ready soon.

00:19:34.577 --> 00:19:36.067
Okay.

00:19:38.982 --> 00:19:41.184
Did something good happen today?

00:19:41.184 --> 00:19:42.185
What?

00:19:42.185 --> 00:19:45.288
You seem happy for some reason.

00:19:45.288 --> 00:19:48.917
Y-Yes, well, a little.

00:19:49.959 --> 00:19:52.450
How was your trip to the cemetery?

00:19:55.698 --> 00:19:58.001
The weather was nice.

00:19:58.001 --> 00:20:01.937
I see. Please wait just a little longer.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:10.013
No, wrong, that's not it!

00:20:10.013 --> 00:20:14.417
There has to be a more efficient way!

00:20:14.417 --> 00:20:17.086
I wonder what smells so good...

00:20:17.086 --> 00:20:19.822
Miranda, what's this smell?

00:20:19.822 --> 00:20:24.427
You mustn't interfere.
She's made a special effort today.

00:20:24.427 --> 00:20:26.229
Special?

00:20:26.229 --> 00:20:29.465
Want some, too, Yuto?
Solty made it.

00:20:29.465 --> 00:20:31.296
Solty's home cooking?!

00:20:35.438 --> 00:20:37.240
Please...

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.609
...go ahead and try it.

00:20:39.609 --> 00:20:40.974
Well, then...

00:20:49.218 --> 00:20:52.455
H-How is it?

00:20:52.455 --> 00:20:55.652
I-It's not bad.

00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:00.897
It's like good old home cooking...

00:21:00.897 --> 00:21:03.399
A sort of homey taste...

00:21:03.399 --> 00:21:05.765
Um, what about the score?

00:21:08.304 --> 00:21:09.405
50 points?

00:21:09.405 --> 00:21:14.110
Yes! It went up! I got a whole
20 more points than before!

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:15.645
It's a subtle difference, though.

00:21:15.645 --> 00:21:20.983
Now, I will train hard in order
to get an even higher score!

00:21:20.983 --> 00:21:22.452
Good luck.

00:21:22.452 --> 00:21:24.320
You hurry up and eat, too.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:25.446
All right.

00:21:33.229 --> 00:21:35.789
Yes, it is delicious!

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:58.251
On a clear day in the park

00:21:58.251 --> 00:22:01.188
Looking up at the sky

00:22:01.188 --> 00:22:09.755
There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished

00:22:12.432 --> 00:22:17.204
Letting the wind
take us where it will

00:22:17.204 --> 00:22:20.140
We live freely

00:22:20.140 --> 00:22:28.181
We make our way,
walking a little at a time

00:22:28.181 --> 00:22:32.953
We're the same

00:22:32.953 --> 00:22:37.724
This precious time

00:22:37.724 --> 00:22:41.561
Each time we meet

00:22:41.561 --> 00:22:51.104
This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness

00:22:51.104 --> 00:22:57.444
I can turn it into the courage
to believe in someone

00:22:57.444 --> 00:23:09.879
And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...

00:23:16.529 --> 00:23:19.232
Miss Rose, I am not sure
that is quite proper...

00:23:19.232 --> 00:23:21.201
It's the basics of being a girl.

00:23:21.201 --> 00:23:23.637
Next time, "Treasure & Rescue".

00:23:23.637 --> 00:23:26.629
I would like to hurry up and go home.
